        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under aerobic conditions, H3ppt (47.8 mg, 0.2 mmol) was added to a DMF (5 mL) solution of Dy(NO3)3·6H2O (92.0 mg, 0.2 mmol) and Na(OAc) (49.2 mg, 0.6 mmol). After stirring for 30 min, NEt3 (20.2 mg, 0.2 mmol) was added. The mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature until a yellow solution appeared, then filtered and layered with diethyl ether. Yellow stick crystals were obtained after four weeks (yield 16%).",
