      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc susceptibility of 1 shows intramolecular weak ferromagnetic Dy–Dy coupling at low T and strong anisotropy. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility under zero dc field indicates SMM behavior with Ueff = 51.6 K and τ0 = 6.16×10−6 s. Ab initio analysis attributes ferromagnetic coupling mainly to dipolar interactions and indicates QTM in the ground Kramers doublets can be suppressed by weak intramolecular coupling.",
